        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "column": "right",
            "text": "<p>Use this space to tell customers what your brand is about. Share the story behind it, the values that guide you, and why you started. Keep it human and specific.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "column": "right",
            "text": "<p>Add a second paragraph for extra context, a mission line, or a promise to your customers. You can edit or remove this text anytime in the theme editor.</p>"
